# Paper figures

- Use `from paper_figures import apply_style` — configure via `figure_style.toml`
- Province colors: `style.color(province)` from Okabe-Ito `republic_provinces` palette (or project palette)
- Figure sizes: `style.figsize(width, height)`; font scaling: `style.fontsize(n)`
- Save with `style.save(fig, "stem")` — do not duplicate DPI/format logic
- Presets: `slide` (dark PNG), `paper` (300 dpi JPG), `print` (PDF + hatches)
- Extend via `register_palette()` / `register_preset()` or inline TOML — do not fork hex values into scripts
